"Any NDEF tag can be the coin: a transit card, a hotel key, a blank. The app keeps a hash of the tag, never its contents. A copied tag is the same coin — the factor is possession, like every physical key ever cut. One honesty: NFC reading needs the NFC Tag Reading capability, which only a paid developer team's profile grants — under free Personal Team signing the taps will fail, and that is the team talking, not the tag." = "Jede NDEF-Tag cha d Münze sii: e ÖV-Charte, en Hotelschlüssel, en lääre. D App bhaltet en Hash vom Tag, nie si Inhalt. En kopierte Tag esch die gliich Münze — de Faktor esch Besitz, wie bi jedem physische Schlüssel, wo je gschnitte worde esch. Ei Ehrlichkeit: NFC-Läse bruucht d Fähigkeit NFC Tag Reading, wo nur es Profil vonere zahlte Entwickler-Team git — under freier Personal-Team-Signatur wärde d Tipps fähle, und das esch s Team, wo redt, ned de Tag.";
"Any time." = "Jederziit.";
