"BTHome v1 is the legacy generation of the BTHome sensor format. Its encryption carries no replay protection — a captured v1 advertisement can be replayed verbatim and accepted — so the house decodes v1 only when you switch it on here, and only ever reads it: nothing in the app acts on a v1 reading. BTHome v2 is unaffected and always decoded." = "BTHome v1 esch die alti Generation vom BTHome-Sensorformat. Ihri Verschlüsselig het kei Replay-Schutz — es gfangnigs v1-Advertisement cha wörtlech widergspilt und akzeptiert wärde — also dekodiert s Huus v1 nur, wenn du es da iischaltisch, und liest es nur je: nüt i de App handelt uf e v1-Läsig. BTHome v2 esch ned betroffe und wird immer dekodiert.";
