"Connect scans only — iOS gives apps no raw sockets, so no SYN scans and no UDP scans. The Send tab is the UDP tool; this tab maps what TCP answers." = "Nur Verbindigs-Scans — iOS git Apps kei Raw Sockets, also kei SYN-Scans ond kei UDP-Scans. De Tab «Sende» esch s UDP-Wärchzüüg; de Tab do zeigt, was TCP antwortet.";
"Connects to each port and speaks the protocol that port expects. A star means the reply carried the protocol's own tell — the port answered as that service, not merely opened. Tap a hit to load it into Send." = "Verbindet sich mit jedem Port ond redt s Protokoll, wo de Port erwartet. E Stärn bedütet, d Antwort het s eigete Erkennigszeiche vom Protokoll treit — de Port het aus de Dienscht gantwortet, ned nu offe gsi. Tipp uf e Treffer, zum ne ids Sende z lade.";
