"Correlation over this phone's own tripwire log: shared habits suggest, they never prove. Two tenants of one NAT can share every trait here and still be strangers." = "Korrelation über s eigete Stolperdraht-Log vo dem Handy: gmeinsami Gwohnheite deuted a, sie bewiised nie. Zwei Mieter vo eim NAT chönnd jedes Merkmol do teile ond trotzdäm Fremdi sii.";
"Costumes dress this device in generic shapes; its own addresses stay its own. Nothing here copies a real device's identity, clones an advertisement the ear has heard, or plants a fake tracker — a wardrobe, not a forgery kit." = "Kostüm ziehnd das Grät i generischi Forme; sini eigete Adrässe bliibed sini. Nüt do kopiert d Identität vo eim echte Grät, klont e Wärbig, wo s Ohr ghört het, oder pflanzt e falsche Tracker — e Garderobe, kei Fälschigs-Set.";
