"EMCON" = "EMCON";
"EMCON active — emissions silenced, tripwire armed." = "EMCON aktiv — Emissione stumm, Stolperdraht scharf.";
"EMCON can verify the broadcast name and the app's emissions. These five live in Settings — check them off on your word." = "EMCON cha de Broadcast-Name ond d Emissione vo de App prüefe. Die füf läbed i de Iistellige — häckle si uf dis Wort ab.";
"EMCON cannot hide this device from the access point it is joined to, and Apple's own radios (Find My, AirDrop) answer to Settings, not to this app. What EMCON strips is everything that identifies the device — and anyone who probes it announces themselves to the tripwire." = "EMCON cha das Grät ned vor em Access Point verstecke, wo s mit em verbunde esch, ond Apples eigeti Radios (Find My, AirDrop) folged de Iistellige, ned dere App. Was EMCON abzieht, esch alles, wo s Grät identifiziert — ond jede, wo s abtaschtet, mältd sich sälber am Stolperdraht.";
"EMCON off — tripwire stood down. Stealth left as it was." = "EMCON uus — Stolperdraht abgstande. Stealth bliibt, wie s gsi esch.";
"Each new line names the hash of the sealed line before it. Verification proves no sealed line was altered, reordered, or removed from the middle of the log." = "Jedi neui Ziile nennt de Hash vo de versiglete Ziile vorhär. D Prüefig bewiist, dass kei versigleti Ziile veränderet, umgordnet oder us de Mitti vom Log entfernt worde esch.";
"Each session is a JSON Lines file in Files › On My iPhone › nightjar › sessions, and shareable from the Sessions tab. On the Mac: nightjar report <file> and nightjar trackers <file>." = "Jedi Sitzung esch e JSON-Lines-Datei i Dateien › Uf mim iPhone › nightjar › sessions, ond cha vom Sitzige-Tab teilt wärde. Ufem Mac: nightjar report <file> ond nightjar trackers <file>.";
