"Every conversation and cadence note is deleted. The pairing key stays — the house forgets the conversations, not how to have them." = "Jedi Konversation ond Kadenznotiz wird glöscht. De Pairing-Schlüssel bliibt — s Huus vergisst d Konversazione, ned wie mer si füehrt.";
"Every device in the list gets its own walk" = "Jedes Grät uf de Lischte chunt sin eigete Gang über";
"Every device the house has learned — names, marks, drift and all — is forgotten, and their Map placements with them. The wire will populate its own cast again." = "Jedes Grät, wo s Huus glehrt het — Näme, Zeiche, Drift ond alles — wird vergässe, ond ihri Platzierige uf de Charte mit ihne. De Draht wird sini eigeti Besetzig wieder bevölkere.";
"Every measure this app owns, announcing this one device at once. Nothing here touches anyone else's traffic." = "Jedi Massnahm, wo die App besitzt, kündigt das einte Grät uf einisch aa. Nüt do berüehrt de Verkehr vo öpper anderem.";
"Every organ in the house, one continuous autonomous run: sweep the wire on every port in the rotation, let it announce itself, then knock — new and drifted devices get the full census, settled ones get their known doors re-asked — pass after pass, for as long as you leave it armed. Findings are named, not just counted: who arrived, who drifted, who answers, who went silent. Everything it learns walks the usual roads: the Neighborhood, the Map, the sealed log, the mind underneath." = "Jedes Organ im Huus, ei duurlaufende autonome Lauf: de Draht uf jedem Port i de Rotation fäge, sich sälber aakünde loo, denn chlopfe — neui ond abgdrifteti Grät überchömed die volli Zählig, aagsesseni überchömed ihri bekannte Türe nomol gfrogt — Durchlauf für Durchlauf, so lang du s scharf losch. Befund werded benannt, ned nu zellt: wer aacho esch, wer abgdriftet esch, wer antwortet, wer still worde esch. Alles, wo s lehrt, goot die übliche Wäge: d Nachberschaft, d Charte, s versiglete Log, de Verstand drunder.";
"Every recorded session file is deleted. This cannot be undone." = "Jedi uufzeichneti Sitzigsdatei wird glöscht. Das cha ned rückgängig gmacht wärde.";
"Every setting in this app has a sane default — the safe, legible choice — and the app runs on those defaults until you configure otherwise. A reset returns every setting to them, and forgets the setup mirror too, so the old configuration cannot restore itself later." = "Jedi Iistellig i dere App het e vernünftige Standard — die sicheri, läsbari Wahl — ond d App lauft uf dene Standards, bis du s anders iistellsch. Es Zruggsetze bringt jedi Iistellig zrugg zu ihne, ond vergisst de Setup-Spiegel ou, demit die alti Konfiguration sich später ned sälber cha wiederherstelle.";
"Every setting returns to its sane default. EMCON stands down, the GATT host disarms, and stealth turns off. Payloads, presets, sessions and logs are not touched." = "Jedi Iistellig chunt uf ihre vernünftige Standard zrugg. EMCON stellt ab, de GATT-Host entschärft sich, ond Stealth goot uus. Payloads, Presets, Sitzige ond Logs werded ned berüehrt.";
"Every tab may wear its own. The Jolly Roger is the backdrop the app was born with — retired from default duty, never from the wardrobe. Your own art is copied into the app and never leaves this device; a GIF plays, a photograph holds still." = "Jede Tab darf sis eigete träge. De Jolly Roger esch de Hintergrund, mit dem d App gebore worde esch — us em Standarddienscht zruggzoge, nie us de Garderobe. Dini eigeti Kunst wird i d App kopiert ond verloot das Grät nie; es GIF spielt, e Fotografie stoht still.";
"Every tab, setting and switch — and Skelli herself, who answers in it too. Anything not yet translated shows in English, never blank. No fonts to install: the device's own fonts carry every script, at every size. Languages that read right to left turn the whole house with them." = "Jede Tab, jedi Iistellig ond jede Schalter — ond d Skelli sälber, wo ou drin antwortet. Alles, wo no ned übersetzt esch, zeigt sich uf Änglisch, nie leer. Kei Schrifte z installiere: die eigete Schrifte vom Grät träged jedi Schrift, i jedere Grössi. Sprooche, wo vo rächts noch links gläse werded, dräied s ganze Huus mit.";
"Everything here is fused from organs the app already has — Listen's hearing, the LAN census, the Night log. No new ears." = "Alles do esch us Organe gschmolze, wo d App scho het — s Ghör vom Lose, d LAN-Zählig, s Nacht-Log. Kei neui Ohre.";
"Everything is where I left it. Good." = "Alles esch döt, won ich s loo ha. Guet.";
"Everything keeps working, quietly: this phone stops listing itself on the Wi-Fi (no Bonjour — reachable by IP address only), and arrivals slip into the inbox with no banners or sounds. BLE hosting must still advertise to be reachable; that is radio physics, not a setting." = "Alles lauft still wiiter: das Handy listet sich nümme sälber im WLAN (kei Bonjour — nu über d IP-Adrässe erreichbar), ond Aakünft rutschid ids Postfach ohni Banner oder Kläng. BLE-Hosting muess immer no wärbe, zum erreichbar sii; das esch Radio-Physik, kei Iistellig.";
"Everything she makes is filed here — take one, or zip the lot and take it all." = "Alles, wo sie macht, esch do abgleit — nimm eis, oder zipp de ganze Huufe ond nimm alles.";
"Everything this phone can hear — the air, the wire, the Night log — in one registry, one timeline, recorded watches." = "Alles, wo das Handy ghöre cha — d Luft, de Draht, s Nacht-Log — im eim Register, einere Ziitachse, uufzeichnete Wache.";
