"Fed only by what this phone itself observes: sweeps it ran, announcements it heard, knocks at its own door. An address is a character, never a person — and nothing here is followed off this network." = "Gspise nu vo dem, wo das Handy sälber beobachtet: Sweeps, wo s gmacht het, Aakündigunge, wo s ghört het, Chlöpfe a sinere eigete Tür. E Adrässe esch e Figur, nie e Person — ond nüt do wird über das Netzwärch use verfolgt.";
