"Remotes for your own gear. A button is a payload from the book, aimed where you wrote — Wake-on-LAN, an HTTP command, an MQTT word, any send the mouth knows. Nothing here reaches for a device you did not name yourself." = "Fernbedienige för dis eigeni Züüg. En Chnopf esch e Nutzlascht us em Buech, zilt, won de s gschrebe hesch — Wake-on-LAN, en HTTP-Befehl, es MQTT-Wort, jedi Sändig, wo s Muul kennt. Nüt do grift nach emene Grät, wo de ned selber benannt hesch.";
