"The gate stands at every funnel: under a condition, a forbidden organ cannot start — not by hand, not by macro, not by her, not by a saved arm returning at launch. Refusals are journaled. A single payload you fire yourself is you speaking, and is not regulated; everything that stands, advertises, serves, probes or polls is." = "S'Tor stoht a jedem Trichter: under enere Bedingig cha es verbotnigs Organ ned starte — ned vo Hand, ned per Makro, ned dur sie, ned dur en gspeicherte Arm, wo bim Start zruggchunt. Ablehnige werded is Journal iitreit. E einzelni Payload, wo du säuber abfeuersch, esch du am Rede, und wird ned reguliert; aus, wo stoht, advertised, serviert, probt oder pollt, esch's.";
