"The hunt needs live ears." = "D'Jagd bruucht läbigi Ohre.";
"The instrument reports for duty: the seal chain proves the record, the census reads the posture, the spar fires sixty mutations of a real capture at your own Serve. The grade goes into the sealed log either way." = "S'Instrument mäldet sech zum Dienscht: d'Siegelchetti bewiist de Rekord, de Zensus liest d'Haltig, de Sparr feuert sächzg Mutatione vonere ächte Capture gäge diis eigene Serve. D'Note got is versiglete Log, so oder so.";
"The last twelve hours, distilled from the sealed log below — counts and headlines; the proof stays in the ledger." = "Die letschte zwölf Stund, destilliert us em versiglete Log une — Zähle und Schlagziile; de Bewiis bliibt im Ledger.";
"The last word — %lld bytes" = "S'letschte Wort — %lld Bytes";
"The library file" = "D'Bibliotheks-Datei";
"The library payload is loaded — open Custom to tweak it into your own." = "D'Bibliotheks-Payload esch glade — öffne Custom, zum sie zu dinere eigene z mache.";
"The living wallpaper has not landed in this build — the retired Jolly Roger stands in behind every tab until wallpaper.gif joins the bundle." = "S'läbige Wallpaper esch i däm Build no ned glandet — de pensionierti Jolly Roger stoht hinder jedem Tab, bis wallpaper.gif zum Bundle chunt.";
"The loop fires only at this device: the target is loopback, and the mutations are of traffic this phone actually received." = "D'Schleife feuert nur uf das Grät: s'Ziel esch Loopback, und d'Mutatione send vom Verkehr, wo das Telefon würklich übercho het.";
"The measures" = "D'Mässige";
"The mind's only memory of itself: which drift it has already reckoned, your verdicts on its findings, and the facts it has learned." = "S'einzige Gedächtnis vom Verstand vo sech säuber: wele Drift er scho verrechnet het, dini Urteil über sini Fünd, und d'Fakte, woner glehrt het.";
"The mind, watching: %@" = "De Verstand, am Luege: %@";
"The mirror — what the wire calls you" = "De Spiegel — wie de Draht dech nennt";
"The morning brief" = "S'Morge-Brief";
"The name of this ear, written into every session. The Mac's fusion uses it to tell your phone apart from your other posts — give each one its own name." = "De Name vo däm Ohr, i jedi Sitzig iigschribe. D'Fusion vom Mac bruucht ihn, zum diis Telefon vo dine andere Poschte z unterscheide — gib jedem sine eigene Name.";
"The names and shapes this device wears: costumes for the air, and mimicry personas that dress the whole device as a class of thing — or as the network's own gear, access point included — until you drop the shape." = "D'Näme und Forme, wo das Grät treit: Kostüm für d'Luft, und Mimikry-Personas, wo s'ganze Grät als e Klass vo Ding aalege — oder als s'Züüg vom Netzwärch säuber, Access Point iigschlosse — bis d'd'Form ableisch.";
"The network gear is worn where an app can wear it — the air name, the listeners, the replies, a listed posture. iOS lets no app broadcast an SSID, so there is no fake radio here: the access point is a shape on the wire, not a transmitter." = "S'Netzwärch-Züüg wird dört treit, wo's en App cha träge — de Luftname, d'Listeners, d'Antworte, en ufgliischteti Haltig. iOS lot kei App en SSID sende, drum gets hie keis falsches Radio: de Access Point esch e Form uf em Draht, kei Sender.";
"The night, understood" = "D'Nacht, verstande";
"The opposite of everything on this tab: Serve listed, stealth off, the beacon shouting, Net-Assault armed, a broadcast heartbeat — this device announcing itself at full voice until you cease it. Ceasing restores the posture it found." = "S'Gägeteil vo auem uf däm Tab: Serve ufgliischtet, Stealth us, de Beacon am Schreie, Net-Assault scharf, e Broadcast-Heartbeat — das Grät mäldet sech mit voller Stimme, bis de's abschaltisch. Abschalte stellt d'Haltig wider här, woner gfunde het.";
"The pairing key decides what opens. Cadence decides what is believed: the seal learns a peer's knock timing from its first messages, then flags any later message that arrives in foreign hands — right key, wrong rhythm. It never blocks a message; it marks it, and the night log remembers." = "De Pairing-Key entscheidet, was ufgot. D'Kadenz entscheidet, was gloubt wird: s'Siegel lehrt d'Chlopfig-Ziit vonere Peer vo ihre erschte Nachrichti, und markiert jedi spööteri Nachricht, wo i fremde Händ aachunt — richtige Schlüssel, falsche Rhythmus. Es blockiert nie e Nachricht; es markiert sie, und s'Nachtlog merkt sech's.";
"The pattern held. Nothing in the house broke it." = "S'Muster het ghalte. Nüt im Huus het's broche.";
"The payload rides in service data for FFF0 — the slot iOS lets an app set. Foreground only, and small: keep it under ~20 bytes." = "D'Payload riitet i de Service-Daten für FFF0 — de Slot, wo iOS enere App lot setze. Nur im Vordergrund, und chlii: bhalt sie under ~20 Bytes.";
"The perimeter tightens itself for thirty minutes when a foreign nightjar-grade probe speaks to it, or a honeydrop is taken: answer in character arms whether or not its switch is set. Nothing else changes — a tightened perimeter stays legible." = "De Perimeter zieht sech für drissg Minute säuber zäme, wenn e fremdi nightjar-würdige Probe mit ihm redt, oder e Honeydrop gnoh wird: Antwort im Charakter macht scharf, öb ihre Schalter gsetzt esch oder ned. Nüt anders ändert sech — e zämzogete Perimeter bliibt lässbar.";
"The playlist" = "D'Playlist";
"The playlist goes. Its blocks were never the engines — those stay." = "D'Playlist got. Ihre Blöck send nie d'Motore gsi — die bliibed.";
"The playlist — %lld block(s)" = "D'Playlist — %lld Block/Blöck";
"The quiet before a knock lands." = "Die Rueh, bevor e Chlopf landet.";
"The record" = "De Rekord";
"The registry and timeline clear. Filed watches are kept." = "D'Registry und d'Ziitlinie werded gleert. Abgleiti Wache werded bhalte.";
"The registry's word" = "S'Wort vo dr Registry";
"The remote and its buttons go — the payloads stay in the book." = "D'Fernbedienig und ihri Chnöpf gönd — d'Payloads bliibed im Buech.";
"The revolving rack" = "De Drehständer";
"The ring" = "De Ring";
"The same sealed box as a knock, sung as tones: speaker to microphone, no network, no radio — it works in airplane mode. Short messages only (sound is a narrow pipe), and keep this tab open while listening. Heard chirps land in a thread named chirp." = "Die gliichi versigleti Box wie e Chlopf, gsunge als Tön: Lutsprecher zu Mikrofon, keis Netzwärch, keis Radio — es goht im Flugmodus. Nur churzi Nachrichti (Ton esch e schmali Röhre), und bhalt dä Tab offe, währendd losisch. Ghörti Chirps landed inere Thread namens chirp.";
"The sealed box as a looping sequence of QR frames — for the room where even a chirp is too loud. The camera gathers frames until the set is whole; the loop forgives every miss. One-way, like sound: no acknowledgement rides the light back." = "Die versigleti Box als schleifendi Folg vo QR-Frames — für de Ruum, wo sogar e Chirp z lut esch. D'Kamera samlet Frames, bis s'Set ganz esch; d'Schleife vergit jede Fähler. Einwääg, wie Ton: kei Bestätigung riitet uf em Liecht zrugg.";
"The sealed log file is deleted and the seal chain starts fresh. This cannot be undone." = "Die versigleti Log-Datei wird glöscht und d'Siegelchetti startt frisch. Das cha ned rückgängig gmacht werde.";
"The session recording right now is kept. This cannot be undone." = "D'Sitzigs-Ufnahm vo grad jetz wird bhalte. Das cha ned rückgängig gmacht werde.";
"The setup file would not write" = "D'Setup-Datei het sech ned wöue schriibe";
"The shape" = "D'Form";
"The station's limits, in its own words: no spectrum beyond Bluetooth is available to any iOS app; Wi-Fi is visible only as the joined network plus what the census builds by knocking; identities are as emitters claim them, per channel, per epoch. Receive and observe — the station never interferes with the spectrum it watches." = "D'Gränze vo dr Station, i ihre eigene Wort: keis Spektrum über Bluetooth hi us für irgend en iOS-App verfüegbar; Wi-Fi esch nur als s'verbundene Netzwärch sichtbar plus das, wo de Zensus dur Chlopfe ufbaut; Identitätä send so, wie Sender sie behaupte, pro Kanal, pro Epoche. Empfange und beobachte — d'Station stört nie s'Spektrum, won sie bewacht.";
"The steward" = "De Verwalter";
"The suit, as you cut it" = "De Aazug, wie du ne gschnittä hesch";
"The tag" = "De Tag";
"The timing fingerprints learned for every peer are deleted. Cadence learns each hand again from its next knocks." = "D Ziit-Fingerabdrück, wo für jede Peer glernt worde send, wärde glöscht. D Cadence lernt jedi Hand wider neu, vo sine nächste Chlöpf a.";
"The transcript goes. What she remembers stays — forgetting that is its own act, under Reset." = "S Transkript goot. Was si sech merkt, bliibt — das z vergässe esch en eigeni Tat, under Reset.";
"The whole house in your language — every tab, setting and switch, and Skelli herself — the moment you choose it, with no relaunch. The room behind this door lists every tongue by its own name, shows the one in force, and turns the house for the languages that read right to left." = "S ganze Huus i dinere Sprooch — jede Tab, jedi Iistellig und jede Schalter, und d Skelli sälber — i dem Moment, wo du s uuswählsch, ohni Neustart. De Ruum hinder dere Tür listet jedi Sprooch mit irem eigene Name uf, zeigt, weli grad gilt, und dräit s Huus für d Sprooche, wo vo rächts nach links gläse wärde.";
"The wire has drifted %lld time(s) since I started counting. Things change their stories slowly." = "De Droht esch %lld Mol abgwiche, sit ech zelle. D Sache verändered iri Gschichte langsam.";
"The wire hums. I'm listening." = "De Droht summt. Ech lose zue.";
