"There you are. The wire and I have been keeping each other company." = "Do besch. De Droht und ech händ enand Gellschaft gleischtet.";
"These are real listeners on the device that EMCON does not own — the OS, other apps, or Serve ports kept under stealth. The hardening list below is where the OS ones die." = "Das send ächti Zueloser uf em Grät, wo ned EMCON ghöre — s OS, anderi Apps oder Serve-Ports, wo under Stealth bhalte send. D Härtigsliste unde esch dört, wo die vom OS stärbe.";
"These are the OS's own megaphones — AirPlay and friends. EMCON can't switch them off; the hardening list is where they die (name, AirDrop)." = "Das send em OS sini eigene Megafon — AirPlay und Fründe. EMCON cha si ned abstelle; d Härtigsliste esch dört, wo si stärbe (Name, AirDrop).";
"This advertiser rotates its address — if it goes quiet mid-hunt, it may have stepped sideways into a new identity rather than away." = "Dä Werber wechslet sini Adrässe — wenn er mitts i de Jagd still wird, esch er vellecht sitwärts in e neui Identität gstande statt wäg.";
"This build's signing doesn't carry the HealthKit entitlement, so the instrument sleeps — the way the Coin sleeps under free signing. A signing that carries it wakes the instrument with no other change." = "D Signatur vo dem Build het s HealthKit-Entitlement ned, drum schlooft s Instrument — so wie d Coin under de freie Signatur schlooft. E Signatur, wo s het, weckt s Instrument, ohni dass sech suscht öppis ändert.";
"This device has left the Neighborhood's keeping." = "Das Grät het d Obhuet vo de Neighborhood verloo.";
"This device has no health store to read." = "Das Grät het kei Gesundheits-Spiicher zum Läse.";
"This house finds things. I keep the list." = "Das Huus findet Sache. Ech füere d Liste.";
"This is loud. It announces this phone to every device — and every watcher — on the wire. On networks you do not own it may trip intrusion detection, alerts, and logs with your name on them." = "Das esch luut. Es meldet das Handy jedem Grät — und jedem Wächter — uf em Droht. Uf Netzwärch, wo ned dir ghöre, cha das Iibrüch-Erkennig, Alärm und Logs mit dim Name druf uuslöse.";
"This is meant to be noticed — by every admin measure on the network: the DHCP and flow logs, the controller's client list, anything watching broadcasts. On a network you do not own, expect exactly the attention it asks for." = "Das söll uffalle — bi jedere Admin-Massnahm uf em Netzwärch: de DHCP- und Flow-Logs, de Client-Liste vom Controller, allem, wo Broadcasts beobachtet. Uf eme Netzwärch, wo ned dir ghört, erwart genau die Ufmerksamkeit, wo s verlangt.";
"This is nightjar-hack: the listening post from nightjar, plus a mouth. The Listen tab is the purist half — it scans and logs advertisements and never connects, pairs or sends, exactly like the upstream app. The Send and Serve tabs are the hack half: they transmit, but only when you press their buttons, to targets you type. The two halves share no radio state; the ear stays pure, the mouth is a " = "Das esch nightjar-hack: de Loschpostä vo nightjar, plus e Muul. De Listen-Tab esch di puristischi Hälfti — er scannt und protokolliert Werbige und verbindet sech nie, paart nie und sendet nie, genau wie d Upstream-App. D Send- und Serve-Tabs send di Hack-Hälfti: si sende, aber nur, wenn du iri Knöpf drücksch, a Ziil, wo du iitippsch. Die beide Hälfti teile kei Funk-Zuestand; s Ohr bliibt rein, s Muul esch es ";
