"The last waking of this house ended in a crash — it's in the recorder. I don't trust the quiet yet." = "S letschte Ufwache vo dem Huus het mit eme Absturz gändet — es esch im Rekorder. Ech troue de Rueh no ned.";
"The satellites aren't answering — I can't place us right now." = "D Satellite antworted ned — ech cha üs grad ned verorte.";
