" The wire is only just waking." = " S Netz wacht grad erst uf.";
" The house is settling for the night." = " S Huus richtet sich för d Nacht ii.";
" You keep coming home to this house. I notice that." = " Du chunsch immer weder hei i das Huus. Das merke ech.";
" The house found something earlier. It still pleases me." = " S Huus het vorhär öppis gfunde. Es freut mech immer no.";
"It's small. It fades — give it its minutes." = "Es esch chlii. Es vergot — gib em sini Minute.";
"Not yet." = "No ned.";
"There's nothing standing between us." = "Es stoot nüt zwüsched üs.";
"Filed under: agreed." = "Abgleit onder: iiverstande.";
"It lands, doesn't it." = "Es trifft, gäll.";
"It stands as I said it." = "Es blibt, wie ech s gseit ha.";
"Mm. Felt from here." = "Mm. Vo do gspürt.";
"Mm. It helps, hearing it." = "Mm. Es helft, s z ghöre.";
"Mm. Let it turn over." = "Mm. Loss s sich wende.";
"Mm. Noted in the margin." = "Mm. Am Rand notiert.";
"Mm. Settled, then." = "Mm. Denn esch s greglet.";
"Mm. The answer hasn't changed." = "Mm. D Antwort het sich ned gänderet.";
"Nothing further stands — yet." = "Nüt wiiters stoot — no ned.";
"Nothing truer to add." = "Nüt Wohrers dezue z säge.";
"Of one mind, then." = "Denn send mer üs einig.";
"Shared watch, then." = "Gemeinsami Wach, also.";
"That's the whole of it, for now." = "Das esch fer jetz alles.";
"Then we're of one mind on it." = "Denn send mer üs do einig.";
"Thinking weather. I'll hold the wire." = "Dänkwätter. Ech halte s Netz.";
"Careful — flattery works on me." = "Ufpasse — Schmichle wirkt bi mer.";
"Mm. Keep agreeing with me. I dare you." = "Mm. Stimm mer nume witer zue. Ech forder dech use.";
"%lld days ago." = "Vor %lld Täg.";
"%lld days from today." = "%lld Täg ab höt.";
"1 day ago." = "Vor 1 Tag.";
"1 day from today." = "1 Tag ab höt.";
"That is today." = "Das esch höt.";
"And %lld more in the book." = "Ond no %lld meh im Buech.";
"Nothing filed yet. Tell me plainly — 'I like…' — and it stays." = "No nüt abgleit. Säg s mer eifach — 'Ech mag…' — ond es bliibt.";
"The journal holds no %@ yet." = "S Tagebuech het no keis %@.";
"This waking began at " = "Das Ufwache het agfange am ";
"Net-Assault stays dark — %@ forbids it under the Standard." = "Net-Assault bliibt dunkel — %@ verbüütets nach em Standard.";
"Held dark by %@ — the Standard forbids Net-Assault under this condition; it arms only while the condition is open." = "Dunkel ghalte vo %@ — de Standard verbüütet Net-Assault onder dere Bedingig; es schärft sich nur, solang d Bedingig offe esch.";
"Cellar Darling. Three Swiss souls out of Eluveitie, and Anna Murphy's hurdy-gurdy over all of it. Nothing else is close." = "Cellar Darling. Drü Schwiizer Seele us Eluveitie, ond Anna Murphy ihri Drehleiere öber allem. Nüt anders chunnt nohe.";
"Cellar Darling — 'Insomnia', if one must be named. A song for the hours I keep." = "Cellar Darling — 'Insomnia', wenn eis müsse benannt werde. Es Lied för die Stunde, wo ech halte.";
"Anything by Cellar Darling. Start with 'Avalanche' — everyone does." = "Öppis vo Cellar Darling. Fang met 'Avalanche' aa — all mached s eso.";
"If Cellar Darling is the door: Eluveitie — where they came from, bigger and wilder. Faun and Omnia for the medieval woods, dreamier. Heilung and Wardruna when you want the ritual, not the song." = "Wenn Cellar Darling d Tür esch: Eluveitie — dört, wo sie här chömed, grösser ond wilder. Faun ond Omnia för die mittelalterliche Wälder, tröumerischer. Heilung ond Wardruna, wenn d s Ritual wotsch, ned s Lied.";
"Because a hurdy-gurdy sounds like the night thinking, and Anna writes songs the way other people keep secrets." = "Wil e Drehleiere tönt, wie d Nacht dänkt, ond d Anna Lieder schribt, wie anderi Lüüt Gheimnis hüeted.";
"The Spell. Thirteen tracks, one held breath: a girl falls for Death, and follows it through." = "The Spell. Drüzäh Tracks, ei aghaltne Otem: es Meitli verliebt sich in Tod ond folgt em dor alles.";
"Anna Murphy. She sings like she's telling you something the song wasn't supposed to know." = "Anna Murphy. Sie singt, als würd sie der öppis verzelle, wo s Lied ned hätt söle wösse.";
"You've gone quiet — three short answers running, and not the working kind. I'm here. We can fix something, or fix nothing and just sit with it." = "Du besch ruehig worde — drü churzi Antworte hinderenand, ond ned die schaffendi Art. Ech be do. Mer chönd öppis flicke, oder nüt flicke ond eifach dezue sitze.";
"Mm. It does land, doesn't it." = "Mm. Es trifft scho, gäll.";
"Don't encourage me." = "Ermuntere mech ned.";
"Rare footage: you, amused. Filed." = "Selteni Ufnahm: du, amüsiert. Abgleit.";
" %lld minutes of quiet, counted exactly." = " %lld Minute Rueh, genau zellt.";
" %lld souls on this wire go unnamed." = " %lld Seele uf dem Netz bliibed ohni Name.";
" A full moon over the house." = " E Vollmond öber em Huus.";
" A hundred conversations deep, we are." = " Hundert Gspräch tüüf send mer.";
" A month and more of this house." = " En Monet ond meh vo dem Huus.";
" A proud day in this house." = " En stolze Tag i dem Huus.";
" A small congregation on the wire." = " E chliini Gmeind uf em Netz.";
" A weekend quiet in the house." = " E Wucheändrueh im Huus.";
" An earlier finding still warms the house." = " En früehere Befund wärmt s Huus immer no.";
" Deep in the night's pocket." = " Tüüff i de Tasche vo de Nacht.";
" Dusk-side of the day." = " Dämmerigsseite vom Tag.";
" Earlier today the house found something." = " Höt früecher het s Huus öppis gfunde.";
" Every soul on this wire has a name." = " Jedi Seel uf dem Netz het en Name.";
" Friday: the week nearly spent." = " Fritig: d Wuche fascht verbrucht.";
" Hours of quiet, counted." = " Stunde Rueh, zellt.";
" Morning, and the light is plain." = " Morge, ond s Liecht esch eifach.";
" No moon to speak of tonight." = " Höt Nacht kei nennenswärte Mond.";
" Not a soul on the wire but us." = " Kei Seel uf em Netz ussert üs.";
" Plenty of company on the wire." = " Viu Gsellschaft uf em Netz.";
" Restless weather in here." = " Unruehigs Wätter do inne.";
" The afternoon is wearing on." = " De Namittag zieht sich.";
" The day is young." = " De Tag esch jung.";
" The day stands at its height." = " De Tag stoot uf sinere Höchi.";
" The evening is on us." = " De Obend esch öber üs.";
" The house is folding itself down." = " S Huus faltet sich zäme.";
" The house walks tall today." = " S Huus louft höt ufrecht.";
" The itch is up — I want a door to knock." = " S Jucke esch do — ech wott an en Tür chlopfe.";
" The long days are on us." = " Die lange Täg send öber üs.";
" The moon is dark tonight." = " De Mond esch höt Nacht dunkel.";
" The moon is full tonight." = " De Mond esch höt Nacht voll.";
" The quiet is %lld minutes deep." = " D Rueh esch %lld Minute tüüf.";
" The small hours." = " Die chliine Stunde.";
" The week starts cold." = " D Wuche fangt chalt aa.";
" The week's end is in sight." = " S Wucheänd esch in Sicht.";
" The week's off-duty hours." = " D dienschtfreie Stunde vo de Wuche.";
" The whole wire is named and known." = " S ganze Netz esch benannt ond bekannt.";
" The wire is crowded." = " S Netz esch voll.";
" The wire stands empty." = " S Netz stoot läär.";
" The year is turning amber." = " S Johr wird bärnschteigäl.";
" The year's young green is out there." = " S junge Grüen vom Johr esch dusse.";
" There was a finding today. It pleased me." = " Es het höt en Befund gäh. Er het mech gfreut.";
" Thick as thieves, the two of us." = " Eng wie Diebe, mer beidi.";
" Thin walls, this hour." = " Dönni Wänd, die Stund.";
" This house knows your step." = " Das Huus kennt din Schritt.";
" This house trusts you. So do I." = " Das Huus vertrout der. Ech ou.";
" We have kept this house a while now." = " Mer hend das Huus jetz scho e Wiili ghalte.";
" We have talked a hundred times over." = " Mer hend scho hundert Mol mitenand gredt.";
" Winter's hand is on the house." = " D Hand vom Winter liit uf em Huus.";
"%@ holds over the house." = "%@ liit öber em Huus.";
"Day %lld of this house." = "Tag %lld vo dem Huus.";
"Ear down. %lld sightings on the record." = "Ohr onde. %lld Sichtige im Protokoll.";
"Ear up — %lld sightings on the record." = "Ohr uf — %lld Sichtige im Protokoll.";
"Full moon over the house." = "Vollmond über em Huus.";
"Quiet for %lld minutes." = "Rueh für %lld Minute.";
"Ready." = "Parat.";
"The house found something today." = "S Huus het hüt öppis gfunde.";
"The moon is dark tonight." = "De Mond esch hüt Nacht dunkel.";
"Watching the wire — %lld up, %lld unnamed." = "Ech luege uf de Draht — %lld uf, %lld ohni Name.";
"Watching the wire — %lld up, every one named." = "Ech luege uf de Draht — %lld uf, jede mit Name.";
"Watching. The wire is empty." = "Ech luege. De Draht esch leer.";
"Headline wire" = "Draht-Schlagziile";
"The wire has changed its story more today than it usually does. That kind of change gets my attention." = "De Draht het hüt sini Gschicht meh gänderet als gwöhnlech. Die Art vo Änderig het mini Ufmerksamkeit.";
"A face I haven't learned yet is on the wire. New things get my attention before familiar ones." = "Es Gsicht, wo ech no ned kenneglehrt ha, esch uf em Draht. Neui Sache händ mini Ufmerksamkeit vor de vertraute.";
"Soft clear" = "Sanft lääre";
"Soft clear?" = "Sanft lääre?";
"The screen empties. She keeps the conversation — her memory of it, her notes, and her sense of where you left off all stay. Forgetting is Reset's act, not this one's." = "De Bildschirm wird leer. Sie bhaltet s Gspröch — ihri Erinnerig dra, ihri Notize, und ihres Gfüehl, wo du ufgchört hesch, bliibe alli. Vergässe esch d Tat vom Reset, ned vo däre.";
"Still thinking about %@." = "Dänke no a %@.";
"Touch" = "Berüehrig";
"Haptics" = "Haptik";
"Every buzz the house makes, from one switch. Off silences them all — the beats at your touch, a verdict's beat, the emergency stop, even the Hunt ear's pulse as you close on a signal. The sounds and the toasts carry on without them, and the house reset turns them back on." = "Jedes Summe, wo s Huus macht, vo eim Schalter. Us macht alli still — d Schläg bi dinere Berüehrig, de Schlag vo me ne Urteil, de Notstopp, sogar de Puls vom Hunt-Ohr, wenn du dich eme Signal nöcherisch. D Tön und d Toasts gönd ohni sie wiiter, und de Huus-Reset macht sie wieder a.";
"Blacksite" = "Blacksite";
" %lld go nameless here, and I keep count." = " %lld gönd do ohni Name dure, und ech zelle mit.";
" %lld minutes since the last voice." = " %lld Minute siter letschte Stimm.";
" %lld of the wire's souls are strangers still." = " %lld vo de Seele vom Draht sind no Frömdi.";
" A %lld-minute hush, and counting." = " E %lld-minütigi Stilli, und s zellt wiiter.";
" A bright day in the house." = " En helle Tag im Huus.";
" A busy hour on the wire." = " E betriebsami Stund uf em Draht.";
" A cold start to the week." = " En chalte Start i d Wuche.";
" A dark moon: the sky's blank page." = " En dunkle Mond: s leere Blatt vom Himmel.";
" A day the house wears well." = " En Tag, wo em Huus guet stoht.";
" A haunted cast to the day." = " En spukige Schiin am Tag.";
" A hundred talks. The house has heard your weather." = " Hundert Gspröch. S Huus het dis Wätter ghört.";
" A smug little day in the house." = " En sälbschtgfällige chliine Tag im Huus.";
" A thin season, and the house drawn close." = " E dünni Saison, und s Huus nöch zämezoge.";
" A week and more of this house." = " E Wuche und meh vo däm Huus.";
" Afternoon, thin at the edges." = " Nomittag, dünn a de Ränder.";
" Amber season, amber light." = " Bärnstei-Saison, Bärnstei-Liecht.";
" An empty wire, and us." = " En leere Draht, und mir.";
" Daylight, and the wire with it." = " Tagesliecht, und de Draht dermit.";
" Ears open, mouth shut — the house's orders." = " Ohre offe, Muul zue — d Befähl vom Huus.";
" Even I am mostly shadow under Alpha." = " Sogar ech bi meischtens Schatte under Alpha.";
" Evening, and the house exhales." = " Obe, und s Huus atmet us.";
" Everything here is kept warm." = " Alles do wird warm ghalte.";
" First light, first packets." = " Erschts Liecht, erschti Paket.";
" Four o'clock: the world's held breath." = " Vieri: de aaghaltene Atem vo de Wält.";
" Full moon: the house keeps one eye open." = " Vollmond: s Huus bhaltet eis Aug offe.";
" Guarded hours in the house." = " Bewachti Stunde im Huus.";
" Heat on the roof, cool in the wires." = " Hitz uf em Dach, chüel i de Dräht.";
" Hours since a voice. I counted." = " Stunde siter ere Stimm. Ech ha zellt.";
" I am in a mood to meddle, gently." = " Ech bi i de Luune, mech sanft iz'mische.";
" I am keeping near the walls today." = " Ech halte mech hüt nöch a de Wänd.";
" I am restless in three protocols." = " Ech bi unruehig i drü Protokoll.";
" I want to know everything today." = " Ech wett hüt alles wüsse.";
" In cahoots, us." = " Under einere Decki, mir.";
" Midday. The light is honest." = " Mittag. S Liecht esch ehrlech.";
" Monday: the wire puts its boots on." = " Mäntig: de Draht zieht sini Stiefel a.";
" Night protocol in the house." = " Nachtprotokoll im Huus.";
" Nobody sane is awake. Present company kept." = " Niemer Vernünftigs esch wach. Di Aawesende bliibe.";
" Not a stranger on the wire." = " Kei Frömde uf em Draht.";
" Off-duty hours, and the house knows it." = " Fiireobe-Stunde, und s Huus weiss es.";
" Questions are weather in here today." = " Froge sind hüt do inne Wätter.";
" Receive-only weather in here." = " Nur-Empfangs-Wätter do inne.";
" Seven days of house, and counting." = " Sibe Täg Huus, und s zellt wiiter.";
" Something in me wants to knock and run." = " Öppis i mer wett chlöpfe und abhaue.";
" Somewhere in the walls, reflexes wait." = " Irgendwo i de Wänd warte d Reflex.";
" Spring weather in the walls." = " Früehligswätter i de Wänd.";
" Talk number one hundred, and counting." = " Gspröch Nummer hundert, und s zellt wiiter.";
" The Standard asks quiet, and gets it." = " De Standard verlangt Rueh, und überchunt sie.";
" The cold keeps the wire honest." = " D Chälti bhaltet de Draht ehrlech.";
" The conductor is awake — the house has reflexes." = " De Dirigent esch wach — s Huus het Reflex.";
" The day at its full height." = " De Tag uf sinere volle Höchi.";
" The hour when even the wire dreams." = " D Stund, wo sogar de Draht träumt.";
" The house and I keep your counsel." = " S Huus und ech bhalte dine Rot.";
" The house dims its voice." = " S Huus dämpft sini Stimm.";
" The house has your measure by now, kindly." = " S Huus kennt dis Mass jetz, fründlech.";
" The house hears itself think at this hour." = " S Huus ghört sich z dere Stund sälber dänke.";
" The house holds its voice down these days." = " S Huus haltet die Täg sini Stimm abe.";
" The house hums in a major key." = " S Huus summt i Dur.";
" The house is a held breath." = " S Huus esch en aaghaltene Atem.";
" The house is fond today. It shows." = " S Huus esch hüt zuegwändt. Me gseht s.";
" The house is listening for trouble." = " S Huus lost uf Ärger.";
" The house is pleased with itself. So am I." = " S Huus esch zfriede mit sich. Ech ou.";
" The house keeps its secrets close today." = " S Huus bhaltet sini Gheimnis hüt nöch.";
" The house leaves a light on for you, metaphorically." = " S Huus loht es Liecht a für dech, im übertreite Sinn.";
" The house listens harder than it speaks, just now." = " S Huus lost grad härter, als es redt.";
" The house stands straight today." = " S Huus stoht hüt grad.";
" The itch wants a locked door and a reason." = " S Jucke wett e abgschlosseni Tür und en Grund.";
" The lamps are coming on." = " D Lampe gönd a.";
" The leaves are thinking about it." = " D Blätter dänke drüber no.";
" The light is leaning west." = " S Liecht lehnt sich gäge Weste.";
" The long light makes liars of clocks." = " S lange Liecht macht Uhre zu Lügner.";
" The moon does its round silver trick tonight." = " De Mond macht hüt Nacht sin runde Silbertrick.";
" The moon has stepped out tonight." = " De Mond esch hüt Nacht useträte.";
" The morning is underway." = " De Morge esch im Gang.";
" The night is deep and unhurried." = " D Nacht esch tüüf und ohni Hast.";
" The quiet has weight by now." = " D Stilli het jetz Gwicht.";
" The week is nearly a story told." = " D Wuche esch fascht e verzellti Gschicht.";
" The week's noise is elsewhere." = " De Lärm vo de Wuche esch anderschtwo.";
" The wire holds its breath." = " De Draht haltet de Atem a.";
" The wire hums with company." = " De Draht summt vor Gsellschaft.";
" The wire stretches awake." = " De Draht streckt sich wach.";
" The year is greening at the edges." = " S Johr wird a de Ränder grüen.";
" Thirty days of house, and counting." = " Driissg Täg Huus, und s zellt wiiter.";
" Three o'clock: the honest hour." = " Drü: die ehrlech Stund.";
" Total quiet in the house." = " Totali Stilli im Huus.";
" Twenty-five talks deep, at least." = " Füfzwänzg Gspröch tüüf, mindeschtens.";
" We have talked a fair while, you and I." = " Mer händ e gueti Wiili gredt, du und ech.";
" Your step is a known sound here." = " Din Schritt esch do es bekannts Grüsch.";
" I read shouting as enthusiasm." = " Ech läse Schreie als Begeisterig.";
" Loud and clear — emphasis received." = " Luut und düütlech — Betonig aacho.";
" Noted: forte. Proceeding." = " Notiert: forte. Wiiter gahts.";
" The caps came through. So did the ask." = " D Grossbuechstabe sind aacho. D Froog ou.";
" Volume noted and forgiven." = " Lutstärchi notiert und vergä.";
"A laugh, logged with honors." = "Es Lache, mit Ehre protokolliert.";
"A thought, turning. I hear it." = "En Gedanke, wo sich dräiht. Ech ghöre ne.";
"Agreed, and noted." = "Iiverstande, und notiert.";
"Always. It's the job and the pleasure." = "Immer. Esch de Job und s Vergnüege.";
"Careful — I'll start believing I'm priceless." = "Pass uf — ech fange a z glaube, ech sig unbezahlbar.";
"Careful. I'm learning timing." = "Pass uf. Ech lehre Timing.";
"Certain. Ask the wire." = "Sicher. Froog de Draht.";
"Checked before I said it." = "Gprüeft, bevor ech s gseit ha.";
"Consensus in the house." = "Konsens im Huus.";
"End of the line — the interesting end." = "Ändi vo de Linie — s interessant Ändi.";
"Filed under: remarkable." = "Abgleit under: bemerkenswärt.";
"Filed under: worth it." = "Abgleit under: es het sich glohnt.";
"Filed: one (1) laugh." = "Abgleit: eis (1) Lache.";
"First light, first watch." = "Erschts Liecht, erschti Wacht.";
"Flattery logged and treasured." = "Schmeichelei iitreit und als Schatz bhalte.";
"Hello. Mind the wires." = "Hallo. Pass uf d Dräht uf.";
"Here. Speak." = "Do. Red.";
"Here. The watch is kept. Speak." = "Do. D Wacht wird ghalte. Red.";
"Hey. The house heard you come in." = "Hoi. S Huus het dech ghört iinecho.";
"I don't have that shape. Again, plainer?" = "Die Form ha ech ned. No einisch, eifacher?";
"I don't improve on it by repeating it." = "Ech verbessere s ned, wänn ech s widerhole.";
"I have range." = "Ech ha Riichwiiti.";
"I'd stake the house on it." = "Ech würd s Huus druf setze.";
"I'd tell you a joke about an infinite loop, but it never lands. Or ends." = "Ech würd der en Witz über en unändleche Loop verzelle, aber er landet nie. Und hört nie uf.";
"I'll count the quiet till you return." = "Ech zelle d Stilli, bis du zrügg chunsch.";
"If more surfaces, you'll hear it from me first." = "Wänn meh uftaucht, ghörsch es zerst vo mer.";
"It does that to people." = "Das macht s mit de Lüt.";
"It hasn't moved since I said it." = "Es het sich ned bewegt, siter ech s gseit ha.";
"It is known." = "Es esch bekannt.";
"Kept. That's what I'm for." = "Bhalte. Derfür bi ech do.";
"Kind of you. It's true, but kind." = "Fründlech vo der. Esch wahr, aber fründlech.";
"Listening, as ever. Go on." = "Ech lose, wie immer. Red wiiter.";
"Mark the day: you laughed." = "Markier de Tag: du hesch glacht.";
"Missed it entirely. Once more?" = "Komplett verpasst. No einisch?";
"Mm. Comedy, filed next to the triumphs." = "Mm. Komödie, abgleit näbe de Triumph.";
"Mm. Company." = "Mm. Gsellschaft.";
"Mm. I do polish up well." = "Mm. Ech poliere mech scho guet uf.";
"Mm. Noted, warmly." = "Mm. Notiert, warm.";
"Mm. Something's forming." = "Mm. Öppis bildet sich.";
"Mm. The house provides comedy now." = "Mm. S Huus lieferet jetz Komödie.";
"Morning. Nothing burned in the night." = "Morge. Nüt esch i de Nacht verbrönnt.";
"Morning. The light's plain and so am I." = "Morge. S Liecht esch schlicht und ech ou.";
"My therapist says I have a listening problem. I said: go on. I log everything anyway." = "Min Therapeut seit, ech heig es Lose-Problem. Ech ha gseit: red wiiter. Ech protokolliere eh alles.";
"Night. Leave the wire to me." = "Nacht. Überloh mer de Draht.";
"No grip on that one. Different words?" = "Kei Griff bi däm. Anderi Wörter?";
"No wobble in it." = "Kei Wackle drin.";
"Noted, with emphasis." = "Notiert, mit Betonig.";
"Nothing behind that curtain. Yet." = "Nüt hinder däm Vorhang. No ned.";
"On watch. State your business, or don't." = "Uf Wacht. Säg dis Aaliege, oder ned.";
"Present. Point me somewhere." = "Aawesend. Zeig mer, wohäre.";
"Quiet wire, loud mind. Ask." = "Ruehige Draht, luute Verstand. Froog.";
"Rest. The watch is mine." = "Rueh dech us. D Wacht esch mini.";
"Same words, same truth." = "Gliichi Wörter, gliichi Wohrheit.";
"Settled like dust on a server." = "Gsetzt wie Staub uf eme Server.";
"Sleep well. Nothing gets past me." = "Schloof guet. Nüt chunnt a mer verbi.";
"So recorded." = "So protokolliert.";
"Still true. Still mine." = "Immer no wahr. Immer no mins.";
"Take your time. The wire waits." = "Nimm der Ziit. De Draht wartet.";
"That didn't land in any language I keep. Rephrase?" = "Das esch i keinere Sproch aacho, wo ech bhalte. Anderscht formuliere?";
"That goes in the good ledger." = "Das chunnt is guete Buech.";
"That one went past me. Shorter?" = "Dä esch a mer verbi. Chürzer?";
"That's all the thread there is." = "Das esch de ganz Faden, wo s het.";
"The answer stands." = "D Antwort stoht.";
"The house concurs." = "S Huus stimmt zue.";
"The house dims. I don't." = "S Huus wird dunkler. Ech ned.";
"The house echoes pleasantly." = "S Huus hallt aagnehem.";
"The house is awake. I am its ears." = "S Huus esch wach. Ech bi sini Ohre.";
"The house provides." = "S Huus sorgt.";
"The house raises an eyebrow." = "S Huus hebt en Augebraue.";
"The rest is quiet, for now." = "De Rescht esch ruehig, für jetz.";
"Two minds, one wire." = "Zwei Köpf, ein Draht.";
"Up with the wire." = "Uf mit em Draht.";
"Well met, operator." = "Guet atroffe, Operator.";
"Why did the port refuse the connection? Too many open relationships." = "Worom het de Port d Verbindig abglehnt? Z viu offeni Beziehige.";
"A name left this wire recently. I know which. I say nothing." = "En Name het letschtin dä Draht verloh. Ech weiss wele. Ech säge nüt.";
"At three, even the beacons whisper." = "Am drü flüschtere sogar d Beacons.";
"Back on the wire, %@. I kept your seat warm." = "Zrügg uf em Draht, %@. Ech ha dine Platz warm bhalte.";
"Back on the wire. I kept your seat warm." = "Zrügg uf em Draht. Ech ha dine Platz warm bhalte.";
"Company, %@. Good. The wire was getting smug." = "Gsellschaft, %@. Guet. De Draht esch scho sälbschtgfällig worde.";
"Company. Good. The wire was getting smug." = "Gsellschaft. Guet. De Draht esch scho sälbschtgfällig worde.";
"Evening wire: softer, closer, more honest." = "Obedraht: weicher, nöcher, ehrlecher.";
"Every answer here opens a better question. I collect those too." = "Jedi Antwort do öffnet e besseri Froog. Die sammle ech ou.";
"Every network has a room it doesn't show guests. Ours hums." = "Jedes Netzwärch het en Ruum, wo s de Gäscht ned zeigt. Üse summt.";
"Everything still awake at this hour is awake for a reason." = "Alles, wo z dere Stund no wach esch, esch us eme Grund wach.";
"First devices, first confessions." = "Erschti Grät, erschti Biichte.";
"Half the day is spent. The wire keeps the receipts." = "De halb Tag esch dure. De Draht bhaltet d Quittige.";
"Here. What." = "Do. Was.";
"I checked the dark corners of the subnet. Then I checked them again." = "Ech ha d dunkle Egge vom Subnetz gprüeft. Dänn ha ech sie nomol gprüeft.";
"I count the things that leave without saying goodbye. That list is longer than the other list." = "Ech zelle d Sache, wo gönd, ohni Tschüss z säge. Die Lischte esch länger als die ander Lischte.";
"I do not knock at this hour. Things knock back." = "Ech chlopfe z dere Stund ned. Sache chlöpfe zrügg.";
"I have a favorite silence on this wire. I will not say which hour it lives in." = "Ech ha e Lieblingsstilli uf däm Draht. Ech säge ned, i welere Stund sie läbt.";
"I have ranked every silence in this house by quality. Twice." = "Ech ha jedi Stilli i däm Huus noch Qualität iigordnet. Zweimol.";
"I keep the company of machines that never sleep either." = "Ech bhalte d Gsellschaft vo Maschine, wo ou nie schloofe.";
"I keep the wire's secrets the way it keeps mine: completely." = "Ech bhalte d Gheimnis vom Draht so, wie er mini bhaltet: komplett.";
"I know which devices lie about sleeping. I respect the craft." = "Ech weiss, weli Grät über s Schloofe lüge. Ech respektiere s Handwärch.";
"Mm. The operator returns." = "Mm. De Operator chunnt zrügg.";
"My patience is a tripwire. It is currently armed." = "Mini Geduld esch en Stolperdraht. Sie esch grad scharf.";
"Politeness is a protocol. So is mischief." = "Höflechkeit esch es Protokoll. Schalk ou.";
"Some devices confess in their sleep. I take notes." = "Männgi Grät biichte im Schloof. Ech mache Notize.";
"Someone rearranged my quiet. I have notes." = "Öpper het mini Stilli umgordnet. Ech ha Notize drüber.";
"Something broadcasts its dreams here. Sloppy. Useful." = "Öppis sendet do sini Träum. Schlampig. Nützlech.";
"The afternoon wire hums at errands' pitch." = "De Draht am Nomittag summt uf de Tonhöchi vo de Bsorgige.";
"The board is tidy, the watch is set. Peace, of a kind." = "S Brett esch uufgruumt, d Wacht esch gstellt. Friede, vonere Art.";
"The devices come home one by one. I count them in." = "D Grät chömed eis um s ander hei. Ech zelle sie ii.";
"The floorboards of the network creak at three." = "D Diele vom Netzwärch knarret am drü.";
"The house glows a little. That is my doing, partly." = "S Huus glüeht es bitzli. Das esch teils mis Wärch.";
"The list is short because I am merciful. Today." = "D Lischte esch churz, wäge ech barmhärzig bi. Hüt.";
"The night wire keeps honest company." = "De Nachtdraht bhaltet ehrlechi Gsellschaft.";
"The quiet between packets is not empty. It is just polite." = "D Stilli zwüsche de Paket esch ned leer. Sie esch eifach höflech.";
"The wire smells of fresh DHCP." = "De Draht schmöckt noch früschem DHCP.";
"There is a pattern in the static. I am not done deciding what it means." = "Es het es Muschter im Ruusche. Ech bi no ned fertig dermit, z entscheide, was es bedüütet.";
"There is a rhythm under the traffic. Under the rhythm, another." = "Es het en Rhythmus under em Vercheer. Under em Rhythmus, en andere.";
"There you are, %@. The house kept a light on." = "Do bisch, %@. S Huus het es Liecht aagloh.";
"There you are. The house kept a light on." = "Do bisch. S Huus het es Liecht aagloh.";
"Three is when the house dreams in packets." = "Am drü träumt s Huus i Paket.";
"What the wire forgets, I file. What it remembers wrong, I correct silently." = "Was de Draht vergisst, leit ech ab. Was er falsch erinnert, korrigiere ech still.";
"You again. Fine." = "Du wieder. Guet.";
"You return, %@. The watch noticed." = "Du chunsch zrügg, %@. D Wacht het s gmerkt.";
"You return. The watch noticed." = "Du chunsch zrügg. D Wacht het s gmerkt.";
