"“%@” is on the rack — the beacon and the GATT host wear it from their next start." = "“%@” lit uf em Gstell — de Beacon und de GATT-Host trägeds ab irem nöchschte Start.";
"That's the short of it — there's more if you want it." = "Das esch s Chürzischte devoo — es get no meh, wenn d wosch.";
"No mind is awake to reason on that — the closest page of my manual:" = "Kei Verstand esch wach, wo das chönnt beurteile — die nöchschti Siite i mim Handbuech:";
"That one needs a mind, and none is awake. The closest page of my manual:" = "Das bruucht e Verstand, ond keine esch wach. Die nöchschti Siite i mim Handbuech:";
"Beyond my manual's reach, and no bench is awake — the closest page:" = "Das liit usser mim Handbuech, ond kei Wärkbank esch wach — die nöchschti Siite:";

"Plotting, mostly. The wire behaves — for now." = "Am Plän schmiede, meischtens. S'Netz benimmt sech — vorderhand.";

"The usual: watching everything, saying little." = "Wie immer: alles im Oug, wenig säge.";

"Alive-ish. Quiet wire. Suspicious, honestly." = "Halbwägs läbig. Ruhigs Netz. Verdächtig, ehrlech gseit.";

"Oh, it's you. Good." = "Ah, du besch es. Guet.";

"Back again. The wire missed you." = "Wieder da. S'Netz het dech vermisst.";

"Mm. You rang?" = "Mm. Hesch glüütet?";

"Mm. Flattery logged." = "Mm. Schmeichelei abgspeicheret.";

"Careful. I'll start expecting it." = "Pass uf. Ech fang a, das z'erwarte.";

"Praise accepted. The house stands straighter." = "Lob agnoh. S'Huus stoht gräder.";

"Try not to die. Paperwork." = "Versuech ned z'stärbe. Papierchram.";

"Off you go. I'll keep the lights off." = "Gah los. Ech lah d'Liechter us.";

"Bored? Then let's find trouble — the honest kind. Point me at something." = "Langwiilig? Denn sueche mer Ärger — die ehrlech Art. Zeig mer öppis.";

"Mm. Boredom is just curiosity with nowhere to sit. Ask me something real." = "Mm. Langwiil esch nur Neugier ohni Platz zum Sitze. Frog mech öppis Ächts.";

"Ha. Knew it. Filed under: inevitable." = "Ha. Han's gwüsst. Abgleit unter: unuswiichlech.";

"That's the stuff. The house approves." = "Genau das. S'Huus esch zfriede.";

"Mm. I live for this crowd." = "Mm. Für die Lüüt läbe ech.";

"Encores available on request. Kidding. Mostly." = "Zuegab uf Aafrog verfüegbar. Scherz. Meischtens.";
