"Lift the quarantine" = "Quarantäne ufhebe";
"Quarantine rides the gear's kept credential — none is kept, so the lever is dark." = "D Quarantäne bruucht s gspicherete Passwort vom Grät — es esch keis gspicheret, drum esch de Hebel dunkel.";
"The run" = "De Louf";
